---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="acquisition" class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100">
  <div class="border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="container-narrow py-14 sm:py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <p class="mb-4 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widestx text-amber-600">Offered for acquisition</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">dwntwnsdl.com</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 font-display text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-amber-600 sm:text-6xl">$50,000</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">USD · Serious inquiries only</p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-base">
          Sister to <a href="https://sdldwntwn.com" class="text-amber-600 underline-offset-2 hover:underline">sdldwntwn.com</a>.
          Downtown first, Scottsdale second — Old Town written for type-in and local search.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="mailto:sales@desertrich.com?subject=Domain%20Inquiry%3A%20dwntwnsdl.com%20%E2%80%94%20%2450%2C000" class="btn-primary">
